702
00:58:56,249 --> 00:59:02,113
Frankly, I'm a little more than a little dismayed at this turn of events.

703
00:59:03,353 --> 00:59:11,959
I think the maintenance issue is something that has come up for years and years and years in this city where buildings are built,

704
00:59:13,669 --> 00:59:15,710
