709
00:59:31,794 --> 00:59:36,856
And I think that this situation should be rectified as soon as possible.

710
00:59:36,996 --> 00:59:37,376
Thank you.

711
00:59:38,056 --> 00:59:39,837
Thank you, Councilor.

712
00:59:39,857 --> 00:59:40,297
Councilor Carvalho.

713
00:59:42,695 --> 00:59:51,379
