714
00:59:52,079 --> 00:59:53,880
That's what everybody keeps asking.

715
00:59:54,140 --> 00:59:59,683
Money was donated, money hasn't been expended, and for the last two years, why are we in trouble in the library?

716
00:59:59,703 --> 01:00:01,303
Thank you.

717
01:00:01,763 --> 01:00:02,804
Name and address for the record, please.

718
01:00:03,624 --> 01:00:07,086
My name is Sam Sednick, my address is 47 West Wyoming Avenue.

719
01:00:08,206 --> 01:00:09,407
