753
01:03:04,937 --> 01:03:14,244
not only just say that we appreciate them, actually acted out in our actions as a city, but, you know, that's just the baseline.

754
01:03:14,324 --> 01:03:20,709
We need to be treating them well, and we need to recognize that if we don't treat them well, other cities are, and we're going to lose this wonderful staff.

755
01:03:21,449 --> 01:03:27,014
Um, and where it's not just unfair, we're hurting ourselves and we're shooting ourselves in the foot.

756
01:03:27,394 --> 01:03:30,337
And so, um, I just wanted to get that out there.

757
01:03:30,457 --> 01:03:32,458
Thank you all for the work that you do.

758
01:03:32,639 --> 01:03:38,844
And I hope that our city can come to fair terms with you, uh, you and very soon.

759
01:03:39,124 --> 01:03:39,885
