911
01:17:14,621 --> 01:17:28,971
Yeah, I mean, I'm just saying all that to make the point that this council's priority for the past six months the past two years has been that the city budget fund and assistance to the solicitor to make sure that the work of this city when it comes to legal issues gets done.

912
01:17:28,991 --> 01:17:32,974
That's not in this budget it wasn't the last year's budget instead we're paying outside

