1208
01:39:39,238 --> 01:39:40,559
Um, my name is Kevin Bailey.

1209
01:39:40,579 --> 01:39:43,080
Again, I'm the, uh, the recreation director in Medford.

1210
01:39:43,740 --> 01:39:48,262
Uh, the recreation department is in charge of offering programs, uh, year round.

1211
01:39:48,982 --> 01:39:57,106
We operate several facilities that includes the, uh, recreation center, Pomal stadium, Laconie rank, the con and shell.

1212
01:39:58,066 --> 01:40:02,928
Um, and we also operate Tufts pool and rights pond during the, uh, uh, the season.

1213
01:40:04,657 --> 01:40:10,282
So we do run programs year round, of course, a peak of our season is during our summertime.

1214
01:40:11,743 --> 01:40:15,526
In addition to that, we also do for administration, we issue park permits.

1215
01:40:15,586 --> 01:40:23,872
So anyone who is looking to receive a park permit, I'm the secretary of the park commission.

1216
01:40:24,533 --> 01:40:28,276
Once it does get approved by the park commissioners, the recreation department is

1217
01:40:28,853 --> 01:40:34,957
responsible for doing the scheduling and try to help make sure that there is no conflicts between our athletic fields.

1218
01:40:37,019 --> 01:40:45,125
To give you just a quick rundown of some highlights for our departments, this year we have seen a very strong increase in our programs.

1219
01:40:46,126 --> 01:40:54,572
When you look at our programs that are running between six or eight weeks throughout the season, we had an increase of 55% from last year.

1220
01:40:55,853 --> 01:40:57,534
So it is nice to see people out,

1221
01:40:58,093 --> 01:40:59,354
using the facilities again.

1222
01:41:01,195 --> 01:41:10,482
We also last year just hired a facilities coordinator who is in charge of operating the Colony Rink in Hormel Stadium.

1223
01:41:11,105 --> 01:41:20,572
In addition to that, that manager has also started an adult basketball league down at our recreation center that received over a hundred people signed up over the winter season.

1224
01:41:21,493 --> 01:41:31,740
And this year we are working with Tony Bover and it meant softball to work on a transition for next year, running the Method Man's softball league.

1225
01:41:31,800 --> 01:41:37,404
This year, we have also been able to achieve a department goal that we've had prior to COVID-19.

1226
01:41:37,965 --> 01:41:38,825
And that was to have,

1227
01:41:41,001 --> 01:41:41,661
Our ski trips.

1228
01:41:42,502 --> 01:41:56,528
