1229
01:41:56,995 --> 01:41:58,337
And we were able to do that as well.

1230
01:41:58,377 --> 01:42:01,361
So it's great to see those goals to be able to be achieved.

1231
01:42:02,202 --> 01:42:07,329
And probably the biggest one that I'm really excited and proud of is having a team membership this year.

1232
01:42:07,349 --> 01:42:13,717
And with that team membership, we were able to expand our team night programs, we were able to offer free

1233
01:42:14,235 --> 01:42:18,578
teen nights on Friday nights when the Chevalier Theater didn't have shows.

1234
01:42:19,578 --> 01:42:28,024
We also did a few on Saturdays when the Chevalier Theater didn't have shows and we did it year round during the winter time on Sunday afternoon.

1235
01:42:28,124 --> 01:42:31,946
So it was really exciting to be able to offer that for the community.

1236
01:42:33,107 --> 01:42:39,230
