I don't see that happening for a long time to come.

1366
01:56:10,354 --> 01:56:14,354
So I just want to make sure that we have that consistent partnership with the Chevalier.

1367
01:56:14,694 --> 01:56:18,015
We know how important they are, but at the same time, having

1368
01:56:18,855 --> 01:56:23,838
that facility there for our youth is just as vital.

1369
01:56:23,918 --> 01:56:27,120
