1392
01:57:39,280 --> 01:57:46,002
But that was, again, I've been involved with that building for many years, and that was never meant to be open June, July, and August.

1393
01:57:46,442 --> 01:57:48,262
Again, that's ridiculous.

1394
01:57:48,402 --> 01:57:52,483
I think to spend the money, and nevermind, now you gotta fill it.

1395
01:57:53,223 --> 01:58:00,088
I mean, I'm sure you can use it for something else that's not going to be as energy costing as that.

1396
