So what's the monthly cost to run it?

1405
01:58:36,410 --> 01:58:36,830
To rent?

1406
01:58:37,171 --> 01:58:37,531
To run.

1407
01:58:37,911 --> 01:58:38,392
To run it.

1408
01:58:39,353 --> 01:58:42,615
Right now, the biggest expense is the utilities cost.

1409
01:58:43,396 --> 01:58:46,058
Of course, during the wintertime, it's not nearly as much.

1410
01:58:46,098 --> 01:58:47,640
We're talking about $2,000.

1411
01:58:48,400 --> 01:58:52,624
When you're looking at the summertime, I'm expecting somewhere around $6,000 a month.

1412
01:58:52,784 --> 01:58:53,545
That's just for electric.

1413
01:58:53,565 --> 01:58:59,389
But again, I would have to really look at the bills to be able to give you a definitive answer to it.

1414
01:59:00,631 --> 01:59:04,194
The utilities that you pay, or the utilities that get accounted for,

1415
01:59:04,969 --> 01:59:05,570
out of the rink.

1416
01:59:05,590 --> 01:59:07,071
Does that include water and sewer?

1417
01:59:08,472 --> 01:59:08,953
It does not.

1418
01:59:08,973 --> 01:59:10,154
It does not include water and sewer.

1419
01:59:17,680 --> 01:59:18,921
